  "thag1.52:1.1": "Vassati devo yathā sugītaṃ, ",
  "thag1.52:1.2": "channā me kuṭikā sukhā nivātā, ",
  "thag1.52:1.3": "cittaṃ susamāhitañ ca kāye, ",
  "thag1.52:1.4": "atha ce patthayasi pavassa devā ",
  "thag1.52:1.5": "'ti. "
}
